  "body": "<a name=\"release-21-15-11-fixed\"></a>\n\n### Bug fixes\n\n- Restore the interpreter search path check for copied POSIX CPython environments created with the stdlib venv creator. An unsafe search path stops creation before `--clear` removes the existing environment ([#3754](https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3754)) by @gaborbernat.\n\n[🐍 PyPI release](https://pypi.org/project/virtualenv/21.15.11/)\n\n[📜 Full Changelog](https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/compare/21.15.10...21.15.11)\n",
